item:
 The fan index.

description:
 Fan speed in RPM (sfosXGHardware, SFOS 22.0 and later). Default levels:
 {WARN} below 2000 RPM, {CRIT} below 1000 RPM. Configurable via the built-in
 rule "FAN speed of hardware devices".

discovery:
 One service is created per fan.
